["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/bulkQuantity", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The amount or measure of a bulk product.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ismn", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Standard Music Number (ISMN)](https://ismn-international.org/ismn/the-ismn/) is a unique numeric identifier for printed music (notated music) standardized by [ISO 10957](https://www.iso.org/standard/83122.html). It consists of either 10 characters (starting with the letter \"M\" for assignments prior to January 1, 2008) or 13 digits. A 13-digit ISMN is composed of four parts: the GS1 prefix `979-0`, a registrant element, an item element, and a check digit. While elements may be divided by spaces or hyphens for human readability, these separators shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., `9790006538424`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Ne0948ace1f9b4b45a50a527f2e1016a7", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/verificationPrecondition", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/InspectionProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Inspection Process defines specific various processes needed to satisfy the inspection requirements for a specific product or service.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/amendedBy", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType", "globalId", "", ""]
["_:N0c14638616554864bc4cba5deb385484", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/iscc", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SbomType/deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ibrn", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Business Registration Number (IBRN)](https://ekys.org/business_identifiers/) is a unique identifier for legal entities standardized by [ISO 8000-116](https://www.iso.org/standard/75117.html). It is composed of two parts: a jurisdiction prefix and a local authoritative legal entity identifier (ALEI), separated by a colon. The prefix contains an ISO 3166 country code, an optional subdivision code, and a register code (e.g., `US-DE.BER:3031657`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nb7a3ba9dda424ac2a2a9277ed23f8a0e", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/statusNotes", "globalId", "", ""]
